## 3. 促销码（Promo Code）发放与私信转化 SOP

### 3.1 评论区第 1 条跟帖规范 (First Reply Template)
> 发出主推文后，**立即**在自己的推文下发第一条评论（严禁放在正文，防止正文被降权）：

```text
🔗 Download & Docs: https://eqt.net.im
⭐️ Open Source Repo: https://github.com/forpersuit/eqt

Works on Windows, macOS & Linux.
Note: Please ensure your DMs are open to everyone so I can deliver your code!
```

### 3.2 私信派送模板 (Direct Message Template)
> 用户在评论区留言后，点击其头像发送私信：

```text
Hey there! Thanks for supporting EQT. Here is your 1-Year Plus License ($11.99 value):

🔑 License Key: EQT-PLUS-XXXX-XXXX
📥 Download: https://eqt.net.im

Quick activation:
1. Open EQT Desktop
2. Go to Settings -> License -> Paste Key
3. Enjoy unrestricted local transfers!

As an indie developer, your honest feedback means the world. If you find it helpful, a quick shoutout on X or a GitHub Star (https://github.com/forpersuit/eqt) would be hugely appreciated! 🚀
```
